WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.547
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Hotel aur Lodge ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:08.097
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:08.097 --> 00:00:17.851
Hotel ka poora kaam booking se shuru hota hai aur check-out ke GST invoice par khatam, aur beech mein room, guest aur restaurant sab ek jagah judte hain.

00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:20.777
Ye Front Desk hai, hotel ka Home screen.

00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:25.804
Upar occupancy, aaj mile paise, aaj kitne aa rahe hain aur kitne ja rahe hain.

00:00:25.804 --> 00:00:37.083
Neeche list mein Arriving today, Late arrivals yaani jo aane the par nahi aaye, Leaving today, Overstaying yaani jo check-out ki tareekh ke baad bhi ruke hain, aur Staying on.

00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:42.690
Kyun? Kyunki front desk ko subah sabse pehle yahi jaanna hota hai ki aaj kya karna hai.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:49.980
Room Board. Har room ek tile hai: khali, bhara hua, safai chahiye, ya kharab, yaani out of service.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:54.174
Upar ke button se sirf ek tarah ke room dekh sakte ho. Kyun?

00:00:54.174 --> 00:01:02.911
Housekeeping ko turant pata chal jaye ki kaunsa room saaf karna hai, aur reception ko pata ho ki kaunsa room bech sakte hain.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:07.840
Kisi room par tap karo to uske kaam khulte hain. Room 101 ko safai chahiye.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:13.495
Jab housekeeping saaf kar de to yahan se mark kar do, aur room wapas bikne layak ho jata hai.

00:01:13.495 --> 00:01:19.211
Kharab room ko out of service bhi yahin se karte hain, taaki kisi ko galti se book na ho jaye.

00:01:19.573 --> 00:01:25.151
Ab Calendar. Ek hafta poori screen par dikhta hai, aur agla hafta swipe karne par.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:28.212
Har room ek row hai aur har booking ek patti.

00:01:28.212 --> 00:01:35.286
Neela matlab reserved, hara matlab abhi ruka hua, aur laal matlab check-out ki tareekh nikal gayi. Kyun?

00:01:35.286 --> 00:01:41.544
Kyunki naya booking lene se pehle dekhna padta hai ki us tareekh par room khali hai ya nahi.

00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:46.252
Bookings list. Upcoming, In-house, Checked out aur Cancelled ke tab hain.

00:01:46.252 --> 00:01:52.904
Upar search se mehmaan ka naam, phone, booking number ya OTA ka reference likh kar booking turant mil jaati hai.

00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:58.487
Kyun? Kyunki phone par koi kahe ki meri booking hai, to kuch second mein dhundhna zaroori hai.

00:01:58.855 --> 00:02:03.693
Naya booking. Tareekh aur room chuno. Standard room ka plus dabate hain.

00:02:03.693 --> 00:02:10.546
Fir mehmaan ka mobile number aur naam. Mobile number pehle ka mehmaan ho to naam apne aap aa jata hai.

00:02:10.924 --> 00:02:13.919
Ye booking kahan se aayi, ye batana zaroori hai.

00:02:13.919 --> 00:02:19.846
Walk-in, phone, apni website, ya MakeMyTrip, Booking dot com jaise OTA. MakeMyTrip chunte hain.

00:02:19.846 --> 00:02:24.152
OTA ka booking I D aur unka commission percent bhi likhte hain. Kyun?

00:02:24.152 --> 00:02:32.575
Kyunki OTA har booking par commission katte hain, aur report mein dikhta hai ki kis agent se kitni kamai hui aur kitna commission gaya.

00:02:32.942 --> 00:02:38.139
Neeche meal plan hai, room sirf, ya nashte ke saath, ya dinner ke saath.

00:02:38.139 --> 00:02:44.130
Aur advance, yaani mehmaan ne jo paisa pehle diya. Yahan pandrah sau rupaye UPI se.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:49.833
Total aur baaki ka amount neeche bar mein dikhta hai. Save booking dabate hain.

00:02:50.201 --> 00:02:51.474
Booking ban gayi.

00:02:51.474 --> 00:03:01.737
Ye booking ka poora page hai: mehmaan, tareekh, room, aur Guest account, jisme room ka kiraya, GST, advance aur baaki balance dikhta hai.

00:03:01.737 --> 00:03:03.909
Neeche OTA ka commission bhi.

00:03:03.909 --> 00:03:10.052
Hotel ke GST slab kiraye ke hisaab se apne aap lagte hain, isliye galti nahi hoti.

00:03:10.427 --> 00:03:17.441
Mehmaan aa gaya. Check in dabao. Room chuno, aur ID proof ka type aur number likho, jaise Aadhaar. Kyun?

00:03:17.441 --> 00:03:24.118
Kyunki hotel mein ID lena kanooni zaroorat hai, aur ye guest register mein apne aap chadh jata hai.

00:03:24.489 --> 00:03:26.013
Ab mehmaan ke kharche.

00:03:26.013 --> 00:03:33.148
Add charge se laundry, extra bed, minibar, cab ya koi bhi extra charge jod sakte ho, apne GST ke saath.

00:03:33.148 --> 00:03:36.958
Yahan laundry ke do sau pachas rupaye jodte hain. Kyun?

00:03:36.958 --> 00:03:42.500
Kyunki chhote chhote kharche bhoolne se hi hotel ka sabse zyada nuksan hota hai.

00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:04.205
Room service. Ghanti wale button se is room ke naam se restaurant ka order khulta hai.

00:04:04.205 --> 00:04:08.488
Chai aur naan jodte hain. K O T dabao to kitchen ko jata hai.

00:04:08.488 --> 00:04:14.457
Ye hotel aur restaurant ko jodta hai: alag machine ya alag register ki zaroorat nahi.

00:04:14.827 --> 00:04:16.746
Ab is order ko settle karte hain.

00:04:16.746 --> 00:04:21.632
Settle dabane par mehmaan ka naam aur room dikhta hai, aur ek button Charge to Room.

00:04:21.632 --> 00:04:28.436
Paise abhi nahi liye jaate, ye bill mehmaan ke account mein chadh jata hai aur check-out par sab ek saath chukta hai.

00:04:28.436 --> 00:04:34.078
Kyun? Mehmaan ko har baar counter par paise dene nahi padte, aur hotel ko sab ek jagah milta hai.

00:04:52.353 --> 00:04:56.896
Dekhiye, Guest account mein ab room service ka total bhi jud gaya.

00:04:56.896 --> 00:05:04.398
Print guest folio dabao to mehmaan ka poora hisaab kaagaz par: room, extra, room service, advance, aur baaki.

00:05:04.398 --> 00:05:10.524
Ye mehmaan ko check-out se pehle dikhane ke kaam aata hai, taaki bill par sawaal na uthe.

00:05:13.283 --> 00:05:19.549
Check-out. Check out dabate hain. Yahan poora hisaab hai: room, laundry, GST aur room service.

00:05:19.549 --> 00:05:27.682
Mehmaan poori payment kar sakta hai, ya split payment, ya thoda paisa aur baaki udhaar, agar mehmaan ka mobile number hai.

00:05:27.682 --> 00:05:32.414
Hum ek hazaar rupaye abhi lete hain aur baaki udhaar rakhte hain. Kyun?

00:05:32.414 --> 00:05:37.214
Corporate ya jaan pehchaan ke mehmaan ke liye ye aksar zaroori hota hai.

00:05:37.593 --> 00:05:42.422
Check out and make invoice dabate hi mehmaan ka GST invoice ban jata hai.

00:05:42.422 --> 00:05:48.442
Isme room ka kiraya, extra charge, room service, CGST aur SGST alag alag, sab ek bill mein.

00:05:48.442 --> 00:05:51.088
Room ab safai wali list mein chala gaya.

00:05:51.088 --> 00:05:58.364
Dekhiye, final result saaf hai: booking band, invoice tayyar, aur jo paisa baaki tha wo mehmaan ke khata mein.

00:05:58.724 --> 00:06:05.263
Hotel Reports. Occupancy, yaani kitne percent room bhare. A D R, yaani average rate per room per night.

00:06:05.263 --> 00:06:08.438
Rev Par, yaani har available room par kitni kamai.

00:06:08.438 --> 00:06:16.120
Neeche source ke hisaab se kamai aur commission, jaise MakeMyTrip se kitna aaya aur kitna commission gaya, aur net kamai.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:22.215
Kyun? Kyunki hotel ki sehat isi se naapi jaati hai, aur pata chalta hai kaunsa OTA fayde ka hai.

00:06:22.595 --> 00:06:30.618
Aur neeche Guest register: har mehmaan jo us period mein ruka, uski ID ke saath, kaunsa room aur kaunsi tareekh.

00:06:30.618 --> 00:06:36.564
Ye police aur FRRO ki checking ke liye zaroori hai, aur C S V export bhi hai. Kyun?

00:06:36.564 --> 00:06:41.006
Kyunki inspection mein register ek minute mein dena padta hai.

00:06:41.832 --> 00:06:42.499
Aur Setup.

00:06:42.499 --> 00:06:50.775
Yahan room types hain, jaise Standard, Deluxe, Suite, har ek ka nightly rate, kitne adult aur bachche, aur uske room number.

00:06:50.775 --> 00:06:55.980
Kisi type ko kholte hain to rate, amenities, aur GST override ka option. Kyun?

00:06:55.980 --> 00:07:03.388
Kyunki hotel ka GST kiraye par depend karta hai, ek hazaar tak zero, aur badhne par pachaas ya atharah percent.

00:07:03.388 --> 00:07:04.923
App ye khud lagata hai.

00:07:07.354 --> 00:07:24.524
Aaj humne Hotel ka poora flow dekha: front desk aur room board, calendar, OTA booking commission aur advance ke saath, check-in ID ke saath, extra charge, room service ko room ke khate mein charge karna, check-out par split ya udhaar payment, GST invoice, aur reports.

00:07:24.524 --> 00:07:28.432
Ek practical baat: har mehmaan ka mobile number zaroor likho.

00:07:28.432 --> 00:07:33.045
Wahi udhaar, room service ka naam aur agli booking ka aadhaar banta hai.
